        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-273155-por/blocks/prose-page-018",
      "source": "sections/page-018.md",
      "source_hash": "fba4210e21d314eaea3de0e1a44c40164bbad3e453fdf8d60b146a1d61a7b432",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Annex 1, a flowchart and notes giving standard procedures for managing indeterminate early infant diagnosis results, including retesting within four weeks and review by a clinical and laboratory team.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-273155-por/blocks/prose-page-019",
      "source": "sections/page-019.md",
      "source_hash": "70e6196f2f149f959764bddbb585da2c9cdd2ad2c68acd46c051102ea2032582",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Annex 2, a follow-up scheme for managing discordant results and stopping treatment in infants, with testing at 4 weeks, 4 months and 8 months after interruption, and scenarios depending on when breastfeeding ends.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-273155-por/blocks/prose-page-020",
      "source": "sections/page-020.md",
      "source_hash": "04a62e4078d5ecbf310447b23a7c6f7b5ac0acf763a887e4176c985d7d4b781a",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Annex 3, a simplified early infant diagnosis algorithm from birth to 18 months, with key principles such as testing maternal exposure and repeating nucleic acid testing at 9 months.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-273155-por/blocks/prose-page-021",
      "source": "sections/page-021.md",
      "source_hash": "069ed556038ffb28144d39adf984d58dec54d7b73db82638912e9dca617d8273",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Annex 4, a risk-assessment algorithm used at delivery to identify high- and low-risk infants for prophylaxis, based on the mother's HIV status, treatment duration and viral load.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
